---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Free Tools"
  description="Free, no-signup calculators from HoneyTools for comparing AI model costs and other everyday work decisions."
>
  <h1>Free Tools</h1>
  <p class="muted">Small calculators that run in your browser. No signup, and nothing you type is sent anywhere.</p>

  <div class="card-grid">
    <a class="card" href="/tools/llm-api-cost-calculator/">
      <h3>LLM API Cost Calculator</h3>
      <p>Compare what the same workload costs on Claude, GPT-6, and Gemini 4 models, with cached-input pricing and a rough token estimator.</p>
    </a>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
